SPATIALLY CORROBORATED RANGE
Each injured cell examines only:
local injured-neighbor evidence.

Working rule:

isolated source:
1-hop field.

source with injured neighbors:
may support 2-hop propagation.

densely corroborated / mature local injury cluster:
may support 3-hop propagation.

No global damaged-area count is visible.

